      </div>
      <div class="footer-col flex flex-col gap-[13px]">
        <p class="footer-head font-mono text-[11.5px] tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-[#6d5a41] mb-2">Documentation</p>
        <a href="https://github.com/dickymuliafiqri/firefly#readme" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-[#c7b597] text-[14.5px] w-fit no-underline hover:text-biolum-glow transition-colors">Quick start</a>
        <a href="https://github.com/dickymuliafiqri/firefly/tree/main/configs.example" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-[#c7b597] text-[14.5px] w-fit no-underline hover:text-biolum-glow transition-colors">Configuration</a>
